# CORTEX VIDEO: sound over USB, the mirror linked, a few knobs and keys, REC; every SysEx the FM-1 sends is logged
# (out:link.syx) for tests/follow_test.c, which replays it through its own engine and checks every frame's sum
wait 500
usbaudio 110
expect link 0
tap REC
expect rec 0
sysex_log out:link.syx
sysex F0 7D 43 56 10 00 01 F7
wait 200
expect link 1
spin K1 3
wait 300
turn SELECT 3
spin K1 8
spin K2 -20
wait 300
sysex F0 7D 43 56 10 00 01 F7
key 18 down
wait 60
key 18 up
key 20 down
wait 300
key 20 up
tap REC
expect rec 1
midi 90 3C 64
midi 90 40 50
wait 400
usbaudio 440
spin PRESET 4
wait 500
sysex F0 7D 43 56 10 00 01 F7
tap PLAY
expect held 1
midi C0 02 00
wait 500
tap REC
expect rec 0
shot link.png
usbaudio 0
sysex_log off
wait 100
